[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さぁ。集めるべき素材はたくさんありますわよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now then. There are plenty of materials for us to gather here."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はいっ！\u3000どこもかしこも貴重な素材ばかりで、\n腕が鳴りますね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "There are so many interesting materials here! I can't wait to get started!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "調味料の材料に使えそうなものもたくさんありますね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I see lots of ingredients that would make excellent seasoning."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "じゃあ、片っ端から採取してけば、\nフロッケのご飯がさらに美味しく……か、ふふ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Then if we gather everything we can find, Flocke's cooking will get even better...?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まずは必要な素材からだよ、相棒",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let's focus on what we came here for, partner."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もう。分かってるわよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geez. I know."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "落ち着いたらまたいらっしゃいな。\nただし、完成した調味料はわたくしに献上する条件で",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Do come again once things settle down. Though I expect a tribute of your finished seasonings in return."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふっ、ありがとうございます",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thank you very much!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うっ、また虫……\nでも、頑張らなきゃ……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ugh, another bug... But I have to keep at it...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うーん……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どしたん？\u3000考え込んじゃって",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What's up? You look lost in thought."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いや、ね。ああやってレスナが苦手を克服しようと\n頑張ってるところ、前にも見たことある気がして",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well... Seeing Resna trying so hard to overcome her fears... I feel like I've seen this before."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えっ！？\u3000ヴァレリア、思い出したの！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What?! Valeria, did you remember something?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はっきりとじゃないけどね。\nなんとなく、見覚えがあるなぁって",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's still fuzzy, but... Something about this feels familiar."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ほんのちょっとでも記憶が戻ってきてるなら\nいいことだよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Even the faintest memory coming back is a good sign!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でも、恥ずかしいから忘れててほしかった気も……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Though part of me wishes you'd forget about the embarrassing parts..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヴァレリアにとってはそれだけ大切な、\n魂の記憶とでもいうべきものなのでは？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "For Valeria, these could be precious memories in and of themselves."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えっ。そうなのかしら？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh. You think so?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ララさん！\u3000からかわないでください！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Please don't tease me!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "大切な記憶かぁ……じゃあさ！\n私が相棒に貸してた大金のこと、覚えてる？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Speaking of precious memories... Hey! Remember that huge debt you owe me?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えっ、た、大金！？\u3000私お金借りてたの！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What? A d-debt?! I borrowed money from you?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あははっ、ウソウソ。冗談だって！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ahaha, just kidding, just kidding!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もうっ、ハイディさんは……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh my, Heidi..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よかったあ……どうやって踏み倒そうか、\n一瞬悩んじゃったわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What a relief... I was already thinking of ways to skip town."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どうやって返そうか悩みなよ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Skip town?! You should have been thinking of ways to pay me back!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "二人とも、前と変わらないね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You two haven't changed a bit."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい。このやりとりを見ると、フロッケはほっとします",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. It's quite reassuring to see them act like this."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もう、私が記憶喪失だからってからかわないでよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Come on, stop teasing me just because I lost my memories."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "魔物との戦い方なら\n身体がしっかり覚えてるんだけどなあ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "At least my body still remembers how to fight monsters perfectly well."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]